- From your PFiles-Section add PFiles:Flut!/Flut as a CNet C-PFile:
   Arguments: 2 2 2 
    These numbers specify the number of ansis available for:
    1. The titlepicture (named Titel.xx)
    2. The "You won!" picture (named Winner.xx)
    3. The "You lose!" picture (named Looser.xx)
    There are currently 2 for each, that's why you enter "2 2 2" above.
    If you want to design your own ansis: the size is 79*17 chars. Save it
    as "PFiles:Flut!/Ansis/test" and test it within Flut!'s sysopmenu.
    If it's ok, rename it as specified above and change Flut!'s arguments.
   One user at a Time: NO!
    Flut! has multi-user support! :)
